{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜《2026香港小姐競選》決賽於昨晚（30日）隆重舉行，整晚盛典高潮迭起。不過在臨近節目尾聲的表演環節中，現場卻突發一段意外小插曲，瞬間引起網民熱烈討論！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"342acdd7-baa4-4201-9188-260b40ec47f0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026lKiwQxyAVb1788167118.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"342acdd7-baa4-4201-9188-260b40ec47f0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在該環節中，嘉賓梁漢文聯同郭柏妍、陳楨怡及謝淑怡三位才女攜手帶來精彩的演奏及獻唱。表演結束後，正當眾人準備走到台前向觀眾鞠躬謝幕之際，謝淑怡在舞台旁突然不慎失足，整個人仆倒在台上。這一幕剛好落入直播鏡頭的左下角，被不少觀看節目的網民瞬間捕捉到。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3552e2b3-8f2d-4424-acb5-17dbb135485d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026WqCrzSwgV71788167117.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3552e2b3-8f2d-4424-acb5-17dbb135485d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d2005f10-d373-4801-bf1f-2b839d1a394d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026imTQZUkHuD1788167117.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d2005f10-d373-4801-bf1f-2b839d1a394d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">面對突如其來的意外，當時已經走到台中央的郭柏妍反應極快。她見狀後第一時間停下腳步並上前詢問對方的狀況，隨後更貼心地攙扶著謝淑怡一同走到舞台前完成謝幕，舉動相當暖心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3e0f2844-c440-40f6-b92c-08b98085209b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/202609JYc4qt9Q1788167117.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3e0f2844-c440-40f6-b92c-08b98085209b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大批網民事後紛紛在社交平台截圖（cap圖）分享這溫馨的一幕，並狂讚郭柏妍的臨場反應與同理心：「郭柏妍第一時間衝埋去，好有愛！」「真係人美心善，抵讚！」「好彩有郭柏妍扶住，希望無大礙啦。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T09:18:41.280253+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":385,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}